  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-11",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不要贬低自己的方案  (Never Belittle Yourself)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Returning to Xingtian late at night, Bu Xiaogu reminds Chun Yuqiao to take his stomach medicine and asks how the chairwoman reacted to the revamp plan. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐嘱咐我，一定要督促病人吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实没必要每天到了下班时间都不回家。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "也没有天天这样，就这几天而已。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在这不是特殊时期吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长找你，是说改版方案的事情吗？顺利吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "目前的阻力很大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是不是因为我做的方案太草率了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的方案是我推到台面上的，你意思是说我太草率吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不不不，我没有这意思，怎么可能呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不管怎样，别人可以看轻你、贬低你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是你自己，千万不要这样说自己。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐嘱咐我，一定要督促病人吃药。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi instructed me to make sure the patient takes his medicine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "其实没必要每天到了下班时间都不回家。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly, there is no need to stay past quitting time every single day without going home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "也没有天天这样，就这几天而已。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is not every day—just these few days.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在这不是特殊时期吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are we not in a critical period right now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长找你，是说改版方案的事情吗？顺利吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did the chairwoman call you in about the revamp proposal? Did it go smoothly?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "目前的阻力很大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now the pushback is very strong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "是不是因为我做的方案太草率了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is it because the proposal I drafted was too hasty?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你的方案是我推到台面上的，你意思是说我太草率吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was the one who put your proposal on the table; are you saying I was too hasty?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不不不，我没有这意思，怎么可能呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, not at all—I did not mean that; how could I?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不管怎样，别人可以看轻你、贬低你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No matter what, other people may underestimate you and put you down.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但是你自己，千万不要这样说自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet you yourself must never talk about yourself like that.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐嘱咐我，一定要督促病人吃药。",
      "gap": 0.5
